OL,3,GNEWSAWaste firm appeals over #51m
OL,4,Arecycling scheme damages claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FWaste firm Biffa is back in court
OL,7,Fseeking damages from the Scottish
OL,8,Fgovernment over the collapse of a
OL,9,Fbottle and can recycling scheme.
OL,11,FThe company failed in a previous
OL,12,Flawsuit where it sought #51m over lost
OL,13,Finvestments in the deposit return
OL,14,Fscheme, which was shelved in 2023 amid
OL,15,Fa dispute between the Scottish and UK
OL,16,Fgovernments.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
