OL,3,GNEWSAWaste firm appeals over #51m
OL,4,Arecycling scheme damages claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn January, a judge dismissed its
OL,7,Fclaims as "wishful thinking" but Biffa
OL,8,Fcontinues to insist that it was misled
OL,9,Fby ministers, who it says owed them a
OL,10,Fduty of care, and is appealing in the
OL,11,FCourt of Session.
OL,13,FThe Scottish government urged the court
OL,14,Fto dismiss the appeal, saying the new
OL,15,Fpoints of law raised were "irrelevant".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
